{title: Every Praise Is To Our God}
{key: Eb}
{x_theme: praise, healing, worship}
{x_source: chrd:every_praise_is_to_our_god.chrd}

{comment: Verse 1}
[Eb]Every praise is to our God
[Cm]Every word of worship with one accord
[Ab]Every Praise, e[Bb]very praise [Bb/Eb]is to our [Eb]God[Ab-Bb-Eb]

{comment: Verse 2}
[Eb]Sing Hallelujah to our God
[Cm]Glory Hallelujah unto our God
[Ab]Every Praise, e[Bb]very praise [Bb/Eb]is to our [Eb]God[Ab-Bb-Eb]

{comment: Chorus}
[Eb]God my Savior, [Cm]God my Healer, [Ab]God my Deliverer
[Fm]Yes He is, [Db]yes He is[Eb]
